# Contact form — direct email delivery (EmailJS)
#
# The contact form works immediately with NO setup: without these keys it
# falls back to opening the visitor's email app with the message pre-filled.
#
# To make it send straight to your inbox with no email app involved:
#   1. Create a free account at https://www.emailjs.com
#   2. Add an "Email Service" (e.g. Gmail) — this gives you a SERVICE_ID
#   3. Create an Email Template with variables: from_name, from_email, message, to_email
#      — this gives you a TEMPLATE_ID
#   4. Copy your Public Key from Account > General
#   5. Fill in the three values below, rename this file to ".env",
#      and restart the dev server / redeploy.

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=
